            "review_title": "Review at Tasty Thai Viet",
            "review_text": "Vincent G\n10 contributions\n0\nPoor by any measure\nMar 2019 • Couples\nExtremely noisy with just a few customers (the restaurant is one big volume with little to break echoing sounds), service was random, at times friendly and for some reasons despiteful at others. The masaman was served as a mere curry, a yellowish soup with a dry industrial chicken. And no manager in the room. A nice, complete fail.\nWritten March 31, 2019",
